@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/benepay-payment

### 홈 데이터
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home

### 주변 매장
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants

### 북마크 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookmarks

### 북마크 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookmarks
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantId":3}

### 추천 카드
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommend?merchantId=3&amount=4800

### PIN 인증
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/pin/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"pin":"123456"}

### 결제 토큰 발급
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payment-tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{"userCardId":1,"merchantId":3,"amount":4800}

### 결제 내역
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments

### 결제 취소
POST http://localhost:8080/benepay-payment/api/v1/payments/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "사용자 요청"
}

### 카드 실적 내부 API (같은 paymentId/eventType 중복 반영 방지)
POST http://localhost:8080/benepay-payment/internal/api/v1/card-performance-events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: benepay-demo-key

{
  "paymentId": 1,
  "eventType": "APPROVED"
}
